OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque unveiled to honour Beagle 2
OL,4,Amission leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum plaque has been unveiled in
OL,7,Fhonour of the scientist who developed
OL,8,Fthe Beagle 2 probe - the first British
OL,9,Fand European spacecraft to land on
OL,10,Fanother planet.
OL,12,FThe tribute, at the M Shed in Bristol,
OL,13,Frecognises the space probe landing on
OL,14,FMars on Christmas Day 2003 and honours
OL,15,Fthe contribution to the mission of the
OL,16,Flate Bristol-born scientist Professor
OL,17,FColin Pillinger.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
