OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque unveiled to honour Beagle 2
OL,4,Amission leader
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He was exceptional," said UK Space
OL,7,FAgency former chief scientist Chris Lee
OL,8,Fwho worked on Beagle 2 with Pillinger.
OL,9,F"He managed to get everybody excited
OL,10,Fabout space exploration."
OL,12,FAnother 12 plaques were announced
OL,13,Fearlier this year to be installed at a
OL,14,Fnumber of sites linked to the historic
OL,15,Flanding.
